Subject: bison

Remove generated bison and flex parser files during clean.

Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/652244
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/746100
Forwarded: no
---
 BASIC256.pro | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/BASIC256.pro b/BASIC256.pro
index 4183a35..c9fe913 100644
--- a/BASIC256.pro
+++ b/BASIC256.pro
@@ -152,3 +152,8 @@ HEADERS 						+=	*.h
 SOURCES 						+=	LEX/lex.yy.c
 SOURCES 						+=	LEX/basicParse.tab.c
 SOURCES 						+=	*.cpp
+
+# Generated Bison parser files
+QMAKE_CLEAN		+=	LEX/basicParse.tab.h
+QMAKE_CLEAN		+=	LEX/basicParse.tab.c
+QMAKE_CLEAN		+=	LEX/lex.yy.c
